{"id": "DF20", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台兼容的数据源支持 19 种，包括 MySQL、PostgreSQL、Kafka、SQL Server、Oracle、Hive、Redis、MongoDB、Elasticsearch 等 [1]。", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1846, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF21", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，报销单需要在 OA 系统填写，具体流程为：员工在 OA 填写报销单并上传发票 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1680, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC13", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，杭州属于一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州），因此餐饮补贴标准为 **150 元/天** [1]。若与客户用餐，需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1872, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据差旅政策，提前7天订机票可享折扣价 [1]。  \n引用：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1717, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，住宿费报销标准为：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500元/晚，其他城市350元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。具体金额取决于出差城市类别。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2228, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，培训费每年有 2000 元额度，用于部门内培训 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 1, "elapsed_ms": 3249, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差期间周六日不计加班 [1]。因此，出差赶上周末干活不算加班。\n\n引用来源：\n[1] 出差时长与请假：出差期间周六日不计加班；法定节假日出差按加班计算。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2044, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1646, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC19", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，普通费用报销（如办公用品等）在财务审核通过后，5 个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1][2]。出差交通、住宿费用报销也需在出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票，但未明确打款时限 [1][2]。若为紧急报销，可联系财务加急，1 个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2059, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满1年的员工年假为5天 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1708, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF23", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的信息，普通费用报销在财务审核通过后，5个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1]。紧急报销可联系财务加急，1个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1697, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "电脑、打印机等办公设备故障，可通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，并注明设备编号 [1]。IT 响应时效为工作日 1 小时内 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1624, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，连续输错 5 次密码将被锁号，需联系 IT 部门解锁 [1]。知识库中未提供其他自助解锁方式。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1799, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF26", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差餐饮补贴标准如下：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为 150 元/天，其他城市为 100 元/天。若与客户用餐，需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。此外，报销制度中也明确了相同标准 [2]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2080, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": false, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": "检索未命中: 期望['员工手册.md'] 实际['差旅政策.md', '报销制度.md']"}, "detail": "检索未命中: 期望['员工手册.md'] 实际['差旅政策.md', '报销制度.md']"}
{"id": "DF27", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公区打印机为无线打印，员工持工牌在打印终端刷卡取件；在浏览器上传文件即可发起打印。[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1817, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": false, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
